	quest.4FAF8F2C53454FB9.quest_desc: ["Construct and test simulated vehicles and airships in deliberate stages: frame, assembly, lift, propulsion, control, docking, and recovery. Start small and test in a clear area. Inspect force diagrams, secure inventories, claim the craft where appropriate, and keep a recovery route before attempting long flights."]
