		"If a &bsocket &ris available, simply place the tool and the gem in the &eSmithing Table&r to apply it."
		""
		"To remove a gem, use a &9Sigil of Withdrawal.&r"
		""
		"To add a new socket, use a &9Sigil of Socketing.&r"
	]
