	quest.5D2B78231DB12B64.quest_desc: ["Choose equipment that matches your preferred combat style, then test it against ordinary enemies before pursuing bosses. Keep spare equipment and food at home. Boss milestones use credited kill tasks, so players who meaningfully contribute can progress with their team."]
