	quest.6912BAE1F6715D30.title: "Build the Cockpit"
	quest.69C7F71E6330CDE3.quest_desc: ["Build a dependable Create workshop from rotational power through brass automation. Stress capacity is the available mechanical budget; stress impact is what machines consume. Use goggles and Ponder before increasing speed or extending a network."]
	quest.69C7F71E6330CDE3.title: "Begin Create Foundations"
